==Notes==
*When in [[hard mode]] in [[Istan]], Kihm uses the skillset that she has in Istan in normal mode (with the added Elite Skill).

==Trivia==
*Her henchman skills were updated in the [[Game updates/20091022|22nd October 2009 update]]. Before this update, Kihm was labeled as a "Healer Henchman" (even in Kourna, where she mainly uses [[Protection Prayers]]).
**On Istan, added [[Remove Hex]] and [[Word of Healing]] (elite), and removed [[Shatter Hex]] from her skills. 
**Prior to this update, she was the only non-Eye of the North henchman with a secondary profession. 
*She wields a [[Hypnotic Staff]] which is normally exclusive to mesmer attributes.

